TITLE:: ActionQMenu
SUMMARY:: A Button with a popup Menu for performing actions.
CATEGORIES:: GUI>Views, Libraries>jostMlib
related:: jostMlib,  Classes/ActionMenu,Classes/PathActionMenu, Classes/PathActionQMenu, Classes/Menu, Classes/MenuAction

DESCRIPTION::
A Button with a Popup List for performing actions.
Closes on unfocus or with esc key.

Supports Button or RoundButton  as a button classes.

If wslib quark is active, defaults to RoundButton.

Closes on click outside or on escape.


CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Create an ActionQMenu

ARGUMENT:: parent
The parent view.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
A Rect

ARGUMENT:: name
The Menu Button Title

ARGUMENT:: items
An Array of String, Association (\key->function), MenuAction.

MenuAction will give you the most customizability.

ARGUMENT:: showArrow
show a little down-tick arrow, defaults to true

returns::
an ActionMenu


METHOD:: buttonClass
Default: Button.

but you can use the RoundButton  from the wonderful wslib quark.

If wslib quark is active, defaults to RoundButton.


returns:: the Button class.



INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: defaultAction
a function. if you a add only a string, not an association, this function will be used.


METHOD:: fontSize


METHOD:: button
the menu Button

METHOD:: menu
the Menu

METHOD:: addItem
add an item:  String, Association (\key->function), MenuAction.

MenuAction will give you the most customizability.

METHOD:: insertItem
insert an item.
before: A MenuAction or in index integer
item:  String, Association (\key->function), MenuAction.
MenuAction will give you the most customizability.

METHOD:: globalAction
a global function to be evaluated on selection

returns:: (describe returnvalue here)


METHOD:: toolTip
set a tooltip for the menu button
METHOD:: arrowSize
default 6.5

METHOD:: arrowColor




